{title: Red}
Colin Alvarez

Verse 1: In D on the riff
Ive been out here in the Sun,
Working my life away.
Holding my breath and counting time,
And bringing home my hard earned pay.

PreChorus: Stops, stall on last low D into Chorus
There Aint no Rest for the Wicked,
And the devil’s on his way.
I cant live for tomorrow,
When I cant see past today.

Chorus:
              F                       G     D Riff
Im gonna get back, Get back, To where I come from.
          F          G      Stop         Riff
Im Gonna Get Back, Get Back, To that Red Georgia Mud.

Verse Three:
I’ve been grinding for so Long,
I don’t know no Other Way.
Working from dusk to dawn,
Home is where I lay.

